restic (FULL_VERSION) DIST; urgency=low

  * New upstream release, packaged from the official upstream linux binary
    published at https://github.com/restic/restic/releases
  * Contains the restic binary, the generated manual pages and bash, zsh and
    fish completions.
  * The upstream changelog is published at
    https://github.com/restic/restic/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md

